+/*
+ * Stage 3 with the GMU just booted (0xbabeface) and its SMMU memory mapped:
+ * Linux's a6xx_gmu_fw_start legacy tail, a6xx_hfi_start, the initial freq,
+ * a6xx_hw_init's OOB GPU_SET; reads; then down unless keep. Returns whether
+ * HFI came up (as hfi_run).
